Thanks Barbara and Rainer for answering my recent query. Victor Eijkhout
and Johannes Braams pointed out that a solution to my problem has
been implemented in the last version of one of the LaTeX styles =
developed
in the Dutch TeX Users Group (see TUGboat 10, #3). The solution is
based on carefully digesting the arguments to \title and \author,
and checking for \thanks and \and control sequences.

Nevertheless: the fact that my particular problem is solved doesn't
mean that the problem-in-general is solved.

Nico


